OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain in the evening but
OL,7,Fgradually easing off. Becoming mostly
OL,8,Fdry by morning with a few clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Windy at times around the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAny cloud and patchy rain at
OL,13,Ffirst will soon clear to leave bright
OL,14,Fspells. Chance of the odd afternoon
OL,15,Fshower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
