OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFurther
OL,6,Frain or showers over the coming days
OL,7,Fmixed with some drier and brighter
OL,8,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light on
OL,9,FSunday and Monday, likely freshening
OL,10,Fon Tuesday.
